    "termsOfAccess": "The Dutch National Panel of Chronically ill and Disabled (NPCD) has a program committee overseeing the program. The respondents have given consent for the use of their data under the condition that each use of the data collected as part of the NPCD research program has to be approved by Nivel and the program committee of the NPCD research program.  All research conducted within the panel has to be approved by this program committee. The committee assesses whether a specific research fits within the aim of the panel. Therefore we only provide metadata on the basis of which third parties can make a data request.  Users can request access via rvb@nivel.nl",
